Supported ESP-IDF versions: v5.4.4 and v5.5.4

This project supports ESP-IDF v5.4.4 and v5.5.4 for the ESP32-S3 target.
For ESP-IDF v5.5.4, use the project's sdkconfig.defaults unchanged. It explicitly selects Newlib and disables the experimental Picolibc option.

Example setup for ESP-IDF v5.5.4:
  git clone --branch v5.5.4 --depth 1 --recursive https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf.git ~/esp/esp-idf-v5.5.4
  cd ~/esp/esp-idf-v5.5.4
  ./install.sh esp32s3
  . ./export.sh

Before the first project build, or after switching ESP-IDF versions:
  rm -rf build sdkconfig sdkconfig.old
  idf.py set-target esp32s3
  idf.py build
